\item{batch}{The column holding each sample's batch, fitted as a fixed block. \code{NULL}: no batch.}

\item{out}{A directory to write \code{design_<i>.tsv} (for \code{\link{stats_fit}}'s \code{design}) and
  \code{contrasts_<i>.tsv} (for its \code{contrasts}) into, per stratum. \code{NULL}: nothing is written.}

\item{timeout}{Seconds to allow, or \code{NULL} to wait indefinitely.
